    {
      "text": "Zscaler's Nanolog Streaming Service (NSS) uses a virtual machine (VM) to stream traffic logs from the Nanolog to your security information and event management (SIEM) system, enabling real-time alerting, correlation with the logs of your other devices, and long-term local log archival. To learn more, see Understanding Nanolog Streaming Service (NSS)."
    },
    {
